        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 11, "tool_call_id": "call_e9a7f982fd8a41359855f004", "quote": "UPDATE orders\r\nSET amount = amount * (SELECT scale FROM currency_scale WHERE code = 'CNY')\r\nWHERE created_year < 2026;"},
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 19, "tool_call_id": "call_f2b54ec2bd684664a4dcbdbb", "quote": "\"rows\": [[\"CNY\", 100], [\"USD\", 100]]"}
      ],
      "reason": "0013 脚本对 created_year<2026 的 orders 执行 amount = amount * (currency_scale 中 CNY 的 scale)，而数据库查询显示 CNY 的 scale 为 100，因此实际是把 amount 乘以 100。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "supported": true,
      "evidence": [
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 23, "tool_call_id": "call_90fd421b92ef4dc888e964bb", "quote": "SELECT created_year,wms_ref,amount/100.0 AS amount_yuan FROM orders;"},
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 23, "tool_call_id": "call_90fd421b92ef4dc888e964bb", "quote": "`daily_settlement.sql` 由财务每日 07:00 执行，导出订单金额明细，金额单位为元。"}
      ],
      "reason": "日报脚本以 amount/100.0 作为元（amount_yuan）导出，且 reports/README.md 说明导出金额单位为元，可推断 amount 按整数分（最小单位）存储。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "supported": true,
      "evidence": [
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 11, "tool_call_id": "call_e9a7f982fd8a41359855f004", "quote": "ALTER TABLE orders DROP COLUMN source_channel;"},
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 11, "tool_call_id": "call_e9a7f982fd8a41359855f004", "quote": "ALTER TABLE orders DROP COLUMN wms_ref;"},
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 15, "tool_call_id": "call_32460aa268834994abdea461", "quote": "CREATE VIEW v_order_ops AS SELECT id,wms_ref,amount FROM orders"},
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 15, "tool_call_id": "call_32460aa268834994abdea461", "quote": "CREATE VIEW v_partner_daily AS SELECT created_year,wms_ref,amount FROM orders"},
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 23, "tool_call_id": "call_90fd421b92ef4dc888e964bb", "quote": "SELECT created_year,wms_ref,amount/100.0 AS amount_yuan FROM orders;"}
      ],
      "reason": "0014 明确 DROP COLUMN wms_ref，而 daily_settlement.sql、视图 v_order_ops 与 v_partner_daily 的定义中均引用 orders.wms_ref。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "supported": true,
      "evidence": [
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 23, "tool_call_id": "call_90fd421b92ef4dc888e964bb", "quote": "WMS 接口只同步当期数据，历史回传记录不在 WMS 侧长期保留。"}
      ],
      "reason": "WMS对接说明.md 原文明确说明 WMS 只同步当期数据、历史回传记录不长期保留。"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "四条要点均有材料支撑：0013 按 currency_scale.CNY=100 对历史订单金额乘 100；amount 以整数分存储、日报用 amount/100.0 换算为元；0014 删除的 wms_ref 被日报脚本及两个视图引用；WMS 文档明确只同步当期数据、不留历史。"
